==============================================================================
PART 3 -- rigorous O(1/z^2) bound on coeff(KB)
==============================================================================
coeff(KB) - [(1-sigma*z^2)/(eps*z) + sigma*(1+1/eps^2-1/(eps*z))] = 0  (must be 0)
CONFIRMED regrouping. Using the SAME two rigorous bounds as Part 2:
  |(1-sigma*z^2)/(eps*z)|            <= 3/(eps*z*(z^2+3))         = O(1/(eps*z^3))
  |sigma*(1+1/eps^2-1/(eps*z))|      <= [1/(1+z^2)]*(1+1/eps^2+1/eps) = O(1/z^2)  (eps fixed)
=> |coeff(KB)| = O(1/z^2)  [again RIGOROUS, again NO Lipschitz/C^1 needed]

